  "body": "What an opportunity! Single-level brick and tile home on a sunny site in one of Stanley Point's most tightly held streets.\r\n\r\nPrivately positioned away from the road, this home has been thoughtfully modernised to create warm, stylish and easy-care living. Offering two bedrooms, excellent natural light, comfortable living spaces, its own carport and inviting outdoor areas.\r\n\r\nThe dependable brick construction and classic brick and tile design provide low-maintenance appeal, while the recent renovations, new finishes and remaining do up potential give buyers further scope to enhance the property and add value over time. The homes also retain a sense of established character that is becoming increasingly difficult to find.\r\n\r\nNorth-facing deck, sunny garden and usable flat land create a peaceful setting with genuine privacy and independence. Enjoy a relaxing garden view from the home, with coastal views, waterfront walks and the beach all close by. No need for a pool when some of Auckland's best beaches are within easy reach.\r\n\r\nFor investors focused on rental returns and future capital growth, this is a compelling investment opportunity. \r\n\r\nLocated in North Shore City, close to Devonport village, Takapuna, the Auckland CBD ferry and beautiful local beaches, the property is also zoned for Takapuna Grammar School & Belmont Intermediate.\r\n\r\nTo download property files, please go to: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/41WA",
